WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.397
NARRATOR: The worker takes the
housing request first.

2
00:00:06.397 --> 00:00:10.435
She tells Marcus that a bed for
tonight comes with no conditions,

3
00:00:10.435 --> 00:00:13.728
and asks what else he needs
to get through the night.

4
00:00:13.928 --> 00:00:14.679
MARCUS: Okay.

5
00:00:15.079 --> 00:00:16.734
That's not what I expected.

6
00:00:16.934 --> 00:00:19.175
I had a whole speech ready for
when you said no.

7
00:00:19.175 --> 00:00:20.296
Yeah, I could use a bed.

8
00:00:20.496 --> 00:00:21.548
And a shower.

9
00:00:22.248 --> 00:00:24.055
Look, since you're not making this
a thing.

10
00:00:24.255 --> 00:00:25.609
I use alone, mostly.

11
00:00:25.809 --> 00:00:27.466
Behind the storage units off
Division.

12
00:00:27.666 --> 00:00:29.321
About a month ago I went out.

13
00:00:29.521 --> 00:00:31.127
Woke up with some guy slapping my
face.

14
00:00:31.327 --> 00:00:32.781
I don't know who he was.

15
00:00:33.981 --> 00:00:34.634
That scared me.

16
00:00:34.834 --> 00:00:36.338
I haven't told anybody.

17
00:00:36.738 --> 00:00:38.292
I'm not asking for rehab.

18
00:00:38.492 --> 00:00:41.806
I'm just saying, if there's something I
can carry, for next time, I'd take that.

19
00:00:42.306 --> 00:00:45.308
NARRATOR: Marcus has told you
about a close call.

20
00:00:45.308 --> 00:00:49.530
What has he just made possible,
and how do you respond?
